                    "value": 2
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>The sanctum knight chooses one of the aeon stars, then fires it from its orbit to detonate into a 20-foot-radius blast at any point within 120 feet, dealing @Damage[2d6[untyped]] damage to creatures in the area (basic @Check[reflex|dc:21] save). The damage type depends on the color of the aeon star.</p>\n<p><strong>Black Aeon Star</strong> void damage</p>\n<p><strong>Gold Aeon Star</strong> electricity damage</p>\n<p><strong>Green Aeon Star</strong> acid damage</p>\n<p><strong>White Aeon Star</strong> spirit damage</p>"
