                "actions": {
                    "value": null
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>A sanctum knight has four tiny motes of light that constantly orbit their head. These four aeon stars are black, gold, green, and white, and each provides illumination equivalent to that of a lit candle. A sanctum knight can expend an aeon star to make an Aeon Blast (see above), but once a sanctum knight has used all of their aeon stars, they become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Slowed]{Slowed 1}. An expended aeon star returns to its orbit around the sanctum knight's head automatically after 1 hour has passed.</p>"
                },
