            "level": {
                "value": 4
            },
            "privateNotes": "",
            "publicNotes": "<p>The devoted Knights of the Aeon Star who chose to serve in the Sanctum of Aroden believed their tours of duty would last, at most, a few years, and that they would emerge from the sanctum with glory and prestige. In truth, when Aroden died, these knights slowly starved to death after becoming trapped within the Sanctum, only to rise from death when the malevolent forces from the <em>Heart of Sarnax</em> got into their bodies and drew back their souls to serve as sanctum knights. These rare undead are found only in the Sanctum of Aroden.</p>",
